# Freeze values for F20 (2026-11-08). Same PREV_* as F19.env (the guest was restored to the pre-F19 checkpoint, so F18 is again the installed previous freeze; F19 was cut but not qualified: its route probe ended UNKNOWN, .local/thesis-next/f19-rp-diag). Derived from F18.env. PREV_* from the F18 records (10-freeze re-verifies them against $OLDH/f18); run ids from evidence/F18/logs.
# Rules kept from the kit: no BOM, LF only, no quotes or trailing comment on FREEZE / FREEZE_COMMIT / GUEST_IP
# (freeze-guard.sh:8-11 reads FREEZE and FREEZE_COMMIT with sed; the mk-svc-config.py and mk-dr-config.py scripts split each non-comment line on "=").
# All comments are on their own lines.
#
# STATUS 2026-11-08: commit chosen (owner-authorized dev-to-main merge, F20); admission ids committed (PR #90); the (b26e5efd, F20) measurer pair lands in a kit commit before 05.
# Every PREV_* value below was read from evidence/F18/logs, then read again on the cited line (the cited line contains the value).

